      "summary": {
        "unit_id": "hmh07-lua-follow5:231",
        "answer": "Builds CoD.MinimapHelper from the supplied eight layout bounds; f1_arg0 is the menu and f1_arg1 the controller. Creates/adds/publishes children in source order: HDRClamp, BackingColor, MapGlitch, MapBacking, MinimapFogOfWar, MinimapFogOfWarEnemyTearing, overlay, Scanlines, MinimapMap2. Exact eager setup, property/asset values, each owned callback, guard and return are retained in the ordered source trace. Configures full compass fog, enemy-tearing fog, overlay and map on separate images with exact diameter parameters. These setup calls expose unresolved renderer/VM contracts; the body supplies layout and presentation only. Calls the shown optional load hook at its exact source position, then returns self. Child/base/provider lifetime and callback invocation remain conditional.",
